  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tsp olive oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add chopped bell pepper and cook until tender, about 4 minutes.",
    "add chopped ham, smoked gouda cheese, sour cream, mustard seeds, salt, black pepper, and chopped parsley. Stir-fry until cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "add chopped fresh thyme and stir-fry for another minute.",
    "add all-purpose flour and stir-fry for another minute, until mixture is thick and creamy.",
    "serve hot, garnished with additional parsley or thyme if desired.",
    "remove from heat and let cool slightly before serving.",
    "adjust seasoning if necessary.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "let cool completely and refrigerate or freeze for later use."
